<h1>06 - Extending IdentityUser</h1>

<p>
    Same app as 03, but with our own user class <code>AppUser : IdentityUser</code>
    that adds a <code>DisplayName</code> property.
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Everywhere Identity used <code>IdentityUser</code>, we now use <code>AppUser</code>:
        <code>AddIdentity&lt;AppUser, ...&gt;</code>, <code>IdentityDbContext&lt;AppUser&gt;</code>,
        <code>UserManager&lt;AppUser&gt;</code>, <code>SignInManager&lt;AppUser&gt;</code>.</li>
    <li><b>Secret</b> loads the user with <code>UserManager.GetUserAsync(User)</code> to read <code>DisplayName</code>.</li>
</ul>
